<title>HONG KONG: CR Beijing Land posts 1st final results.</title>
<headline>CR Beijing Land posts 1st final results.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   26.0</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    7.2</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  10.52 gain</p>
<p>    Net			    250.39</p>
<p>    Turnover		     720.71</p>
<p>    Company name		 China Resources Beijing Land Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  May 22-28</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   June 6</p>
<p>NOTE - China Resources Beijing Land, the spinoff China property arm of China Resources Enterprise Ltd, was listed on the Stock Exchange on November 8, 1996.</p>
<p>The exceptional item represents interest income on application monies received on issue of new shares.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
